# Project: corpus and outputs (corpus/manifests/ IS tracked)
# corpus/raw and corpus/processed are tracked via Git-LFS (see .gitattributes)
# corpus/indexes is the LanceDB store, kept local per machine
corpus/indexes/
*.lance
evals/reports/*
!evals/reports/latest.md
# H12 A/B arm reports — tracked as TFM evidence (contaminated/partial; see
# docs/cost_analysis.md caveats). Mirrors the !latest.md exception.
!evals/reports/latest.evaluation.md
!evals/reports/latest.cost.md
!evals/reports/latest.council.md
# v0.1.20 paid validation A/B reports — tracked as TFM evidence (paid measurement
# artifacts; ARM A baseline + ARM B candidate + comparison + safety floor +
# probe summaries + SKIP/PROCEED decision). See spec docs/superpowers/specs/
# 2026-05-23-v0.1.20-paid-validation-design.md.
!evals/reports/v0.1.20/
!evals/reports/v0.1.20/*
# v0.1.21 quorum diagnostic + closure reports — tracked as TFM evidence
!evals/reports/v0.1.21/
!evals/reports/v0.1.21/*
# v0.1.22 paid validation reports — tracked as TFM evidence (cumulative-impact
# measurement vs v0.1.20 ARM B baseline; includes preserved probe-attempt-{1,2,3}
# evidence files for §22.22 disclosure of SSL + Capa A infrastructure block + fix).
# See ADR-0029 + spec docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-24-v0.1.22-paid-validation-design.md.
!evals/reports/v0.1.22/
!evals/reports/v0.1.22/*
# v0.1.22.1 verdict-match drop diagnostic reports — tracked as TFM evidence
# ($0 cache-mining; 4-hypothesis attribution + v0.1.23 decision-tree). See
# spec docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-25-v0.1.22.1-verdict-diagnostic-design.md.
!evals/reports/v0.1.22.1/
!evals/reports/v0.1.22.1/*
# v0.1.23 Auditor lenient quorum paid validation reports — tracked as TFM evidence
# (1-arm fresh post-fix vs cached v0.1.22-prod baseline; ~€2 paid; Design B per
# ADR-0030). See spec docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-25-v0.1.23-auditor-lenient-quorum-design.md.
!evals/reports/v0.1.23/
!evals/reports/v0.1.23/*
evals/cache/
evals/reports/archive/
